                                                "sense_id": "324d5aa7-2226-3837-8ead-e035c31d1f51",
                                                "text": "It has also become an influential subculture in the Bay Area, where devotees commonly refer to themselves as effective altruists in the same way they might describe themselves as leftists or psychonauts."
